 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Canonical structure of type II",
     "texto": [
      "**Protasis (the condition)**: always with **se + imperfect subjunctive** (**Se avessi soldi**, **Se potessi scegliere**).",
      "**Apodosis (the consequence)**: in the **present conditional** (**comprerei una casa**, **andrei al mare**). Never use the conditional after *se*!"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The advice formula «Se fossi in te»",
     "texto": [
      "It is exactly equivalent to «if I were you» or «if I were in your place». It is the most idiomatic way to recommend a course of action: **Se fossi in te, chiederei una vacanza** (if I were you, I would ask for a holiday)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Condition (se + imperfect subjunctive)",
